WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.360
Behind the Order.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.150
A case review in the Compliance Sandbox.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.930
Open the Compliance Sandbox from the desktop.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.150
Ten flagged cases, ranked by a model score.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.770
Select one to open its record.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.920
The score is one input.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.530
Read every field before you decide.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.880
Drag a case into a tier, or select it and choose.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.580
You can change it until you confirm.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.070
Your work saves as a draft.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.620
Confirming commits it to the record.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.230
Everything you record is kept in the case file.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.640
Minimise or close whenever you need to.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.430
Your work stays where you left it.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.950
Take your time. Let's begin.
